 * @var array<int,array> $rows see ExportFamilyBookBranches::branchRowsForPage()
 * @var array<string,array{label: string, url: string}> $people
 * @var string $base hash of the list, to recognize changes in the meantime
 * @var array{h5: string, h6: string} $headings default headings of the book
 * @var array $profile see ExportFamilyBookProfiles::profileBarData()
